# {{ .DisplayName }} module instructions

## Scope

This file applies to `modules/{{ .ModuleName }}/` and inherits the repository-root `AGENTS.md`.

## Source contract

- Canonical specification: `module.yaml`
- Module name: `{{ .ModuleName }}`
- API resource: `/admin/api/{{ .APIResource }}`
- Permission prefix: `{{ .ModuleName }}:`

## Generated and custom code

Files with a `Code generated by mss` header are derived from `module.yaml`. Change the specification or generator templates instead of editing generated output manually.

Put non-template business rules in explicitly custom files such as `service_custom.go`, `hooks_custom.go`, or focused test files without a generated header.

## Required validation

```shell
go run ./cmd/mss spec validate modules/{{ .ModuleName }}/module.yaml
go run ./cmd/mss module generate modules/{{ .ModuleName }}/module.yaml --check
go test ./modules/{{ .ModuleName }}/...
go run ./cmd/mss verify --module {{ .ModuleName }}
```

Backend authorization is mandatory even when the frontend hides an action.
